
  <sn><md>### Local to Cloud Operations

With rclone, you can transfer and manage files between your **local computer** and cloud storage.

### Basic Format

```bash
rclone command LOCAL_PATH REMOTE_PATH
```

Here:

| Part        | Example                | Meaning                       |
| ----------- | ---------------------- | ----------------------------- |
| Local path  | `/home/emon/Documents` | Source files on your computer |
| Remote path | `mega:Backup`          | Destination in cloud storage  |

</md></sn>
